  dialogues:
  - Hello, I am a knight from XXXX. You are new here right?
  - There is a gym where you can upgrade here. (Increase your HP, Strength, and Speed)
  - And a spring to heal.
  - There is a prisoner near the spring. He seems to know much more about the world
    than I do.
  - Do you have any other questions?
